[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日もお疲れ様\r\n良い撮影だったぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00011",
    "bgm": "016",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう言ってもらえると頑張った甲斐があるよ\r\n見てくれる人にも喜んでもらえたらいいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このあと、事務所に戻らないといけないけど……\r\nまだ時間に余裕はあるから、ゆっくりしていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、スイーツフェアをやってるみたいだぞ\r\nせっかくだから、何かどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nへぇ……いろんな種類があるね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "芳醇な香りのブランデーを使った大人風味のモンブラン……\r\n幾重にも重なるモカが重厚な味わいのオペラ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだか、咲耶が言うとすごく美味しそうに聞こえるな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス。それじゃあ、プロデューサーも一緒にどうだい？\r\nひとりよりも、誰かと一緒に楽しみたいな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶がそう言うなら……\r\nじゃあ、どのケーキにしようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "んー……よし、私はこのベリーのカルテットケーキにしよう　\r\nベリーも生クリームもたっぷりで、美味しそうだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それと飲み物か……\r\n今日はコーヒーにしようかな",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、咲耶は紅茶派じゃなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、よく見ているんだね\r\nありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "甘いケーキの時は、苦みのあるコーヒーの方が好きなんだ\r\nこのお店は、コーヒーの種類も豊富みたいだしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、そういうことか\r\n俺なんか、ついいつもコーヒーになっちゃうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "お互いの良さを引き立て、\r\n高め合うような組み合わせをマリアージュと言ってね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "素晴らしい味がさらに美味しく際立って\r\n幸せな気持ちを運んでくれるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そんなマリアージュを探すのも\r\n色々な可能性を覗くようで楽しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なんて、釈迦に説法だったね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どういうことだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "恋鐘、摩美々、結華に霧子、そして私\r\nアンティーカは、誰ひとりが欠けても同じ輝きは発せない",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは俺じゃなくて、咲耶たちの力だけどな\r\nでも組み合わせの可能性なんて、咲耶が好きそうな話だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね。世界にはまだ見ぬ組み合わせや可能性が\r\nたくさん秘められているかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……私とプロデューサーならば、\r\nどんな可能性を生み出すんだろうね……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（冗談とはわかっているけど\r\nたまに距離感を詰めてくるな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なんて、年長者をからかうのはほどほどにして……\r\nんー、コーヒーはグアテマラにしようかな",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "苦みと酸味のバランスが絶妙で\r\nフルーツと生クリームたっぷりのケーキに合うと思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、俺はケーキはこれにして、\r\n飲み物は……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "咲耶と同じものを",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "紅茶にしようかな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "いつものコーヒーに\r\nするかな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020180,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、プロデューサーの選んだ\r\nフォンダンショコラにも、グアテマラは合うと思うよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "でも、私と同じものでいいのかい？\r\n香り高いケニアのコーヒーや、ブレンドも合うと思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶と同じものを飲んでみたかったんだ\r\nだけど、俺が選んだケーキにも合うのなら良かったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど、そういうことか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の選んだコーヒーがプロデューサーの口に合うか、\r\nぜひ感想を聞かせてほしいな",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "人それぞれ好物が違うように、\r\n同じものを口にしても感想は人それぞれ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから、アナタがどんな感性でどんな感想を抱くのか\r\n是非教えてほしいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もし、アナタも美味しいと言ってくれるなら……\r\nフフ、これほど嬉しいことはないね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020250,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、プロデューサーが紅茶なんて、珍しいね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶はよく紅茶を飲んでるだろ？\r\nちょっと気になってたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど、そうだったんだね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の行動がプロデューサーの新たな扉を開いたのなら\r\n……フフ、嬉しいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶がどんなものを好きなのか、知っておきたいからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それじゃあ、私のおすすめの茶葉を教えようか",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "紅茶を通して、私のことを更に知ってくれると嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020290"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020300,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そういえば、プロデューサーは\r\nいつもどんなコーヒーを飲んでいるんだい？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　俺はいつもブレンドだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "へぇ……淹れ方にも、こだわりがあったりするのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通に淹れるだけで、特にこだわりはないが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "その『普通』にこそ\r\nその人のこだわりが見えるものだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そういうものなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、そういうものなんだ\r\nふとした瞬間に、その人の『素』が見えるようにね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……そうだ。いつかプロデューサーが\r\nコーヒーを淹れているところを見せてくれないかい？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004020350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "その時のアナタの表情、好む味わい……\r\n私の知らないアナタを、もっと見せてほしいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600402/2006004020350"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]